  "worked_solution": "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $y=2x,$ we first replace $y$ with $2x$ in the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}14{x}^{2}-3{y}^{2} & =50 \\\\ 14{x}^{2}-3(2x)^{2} & =50 \\\\ 14{x}^{2}-12{x}^{2} & =50 \\\\ 2{x}^{2} & =50 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =25 \\\\ x & =\\pm 5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
